    "excerpt": "Spring tides Spring tides at Saltmere reach 5.2 metres, two days after the full and new moon. High water at the outer mole comes about forty minutes after high water at the bar. Neap tides Neap tides rise to 3.9 metres; berth 3 still dries at low water.",
